        "answer": {
          "short": "60 men",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}20\\%\\text{ of the men}&=12\\text{ men}\\\\1\\%\\text{ of the men}&=12\\div20=0.6\\text{ men}\\\\100\\%\\text{ of the men}&=0.6\\times100=60\\text{ men}\\end{align*}$$",
