        "answer": {
          "short": "80 women",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}3\\text{ parts}&=60\\text{ employees}\\\\1\\text{ part}&=60\\div3=20\\text{ employees}\\\\4\\text{ parts}&=20\\times4=80\\text{ employees}\\end{align*}$$\nThere are 80 women.",
